Subject: [PATCH] libcamera: qcom: add factory AE/AF controllers and SSC
 gravity compensation

Add Chromatix histogram AE, FastConv exposure convergence, EV compensation,
LG AE histogram flatness, LG SFAF contrast autofocus, sensor tuning tables,
and SSC accelerometer gravity compensation for the main camera lens.
